diff --git a/REVIEW.md b/REVIEW.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..6ace0bebe98995d07423c9ad57ea5ab4c242127b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/REVIEW.md
@@ -0,0 +1,575 @@
+# Independent adversarial audit: 114-minSubArraySum
+
+## Executive decision
+
+The candidate contains a legitimate, freshly reconstructed partial-correctness
